help.prompt:
I am a beginner following a step-by-step guide to get an AI agent running on my laptop for a workshop.

My computer: {os}
My AI agent: {agent}
The step I am on: {step}

This is the error, or what I see:
{error}

Explain in plain words what went wrong and tell me what to do next, one small step at a time. Do not assume I know the terminal. Check the actual extracted folder rather than assuming a Downloads path. Do not suggest bypassing company policy, administrator restrictions, execution policy, TLS checks, proxies or security software. If this needs organizational approval or configuration, explain what to ask IT. Remind me to redact secrets and confidential details.
